Vamos, está tudo bem!

872
01:23:11,653 --> 01:23:12,279
Vamos!

873
01:23:23,582 --> 01:23:24,458
John!

874
01:23:24,791 --> 01:23:25,501
John!

875
01:23:25,834 --> 01:23:26,460
John!

876
01:23:27,419 --> 01:23:28,170
John!

